      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b46cade55708a657f724518|full_name}: I don't think it is easy to have this.\n\nThe way tracking pucks are, if anything, this is more an issue with the pucks themselves, not VRchat.\n\nThe pucks sync up differently each time, and VRchat's work around is to manually sync up when you change avatars.  Sure, for a given instance of VRchat, it could be synced and remain synced after changing avatars, but sometimes the pucks will rotate, or you put on the wrong foot.\n\nFor the time being, this is the best option we have for tracking.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
